{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e19-scene-05",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "谢灵接管制作一部  (Xie Ling Takes Over Unit One)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xie_ling": "谢灵",
    "crew": "场务",
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "When Xie Ling's deputy orders all of Production Unit One to submit resumes and reports before the end of the day, bewildered staff demand to know where Chun Yuqiao went. Listen to the Mandarin commotion first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "制作一部的人注意了，这位是我们新任的总制作人谢总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "今天下班以前，所有人向总编室提交个人简历和工作简报。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "不是，这哪儿来的谢总啊？淳于总呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "一部是淳于总一手带出来的，没有淳于总坐镇还怎么运作啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "怎么变成谢总了？我们淳于总到底去哪儿了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不对，搞错了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们偏偏证明了，星天是可以没有淳于总的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "是不是看见我来特别意外？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "给你们个建议啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "与其在这儿发呆，还不如赶紧去收拾自己的东西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "因为我自己的团队，马上就要全面入驻总编室了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你们现在就可以考虑自己的出路了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "制作一部的人注意了，这位是我们新任的总制作人谢总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Attention everyone in Production Unit One: this is our new chief producer, Mr Xie.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "今天下班以前，所有人向总编室提交个人简历和工作简报。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Before clocking out today, everyone must submit a resume and work brief to the chief editor office.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "不是，这哪儿来的谢总啊？淳于总呢？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hold on, where did this Mr Xie come from? Where is Mr Chun Yuqiao?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "一部是淳于总一手带出来的，没有淳于总坐镇还怎么运作啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Unit One was built single-handedly by Mr Chun Yuqiao; how can it operate without him in charge?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "怎么变成谢总了？我们淳于总到底去哪儿了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'How did it turn into Mr Xie? Where on earth has our Mr Chun Yuqiao gone?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "不对，搞错了！",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'No, wait—we got it all backwards!'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "咱们偏偏证明了，星天是可以没有淳于总的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'We ended up proving that Xingtian can manage without Mr Chun Yuqiao after all.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "是不是看见我来特别意外？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Are you especially surprised to see me show up here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "给你们个建议啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Let me offer the three of you a piece of advice.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "与其在这儿发呆，还不如赶紧去收拾自己的东西。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Rather than standing here in a daze, you might as well hurry and pack your belongings.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "因为我自己的团队，马上就要全面入驻总编室了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Because my own team is about to move into the chief editor office in full force.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你们现在就可以考虑自己的出路了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'You can start thinking about your own next career move right now.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "crew",
      "t": "制作一部的人注意了，这位是我们新任的总制作人谢总。",
      "gap": 0.5
