    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "与其在这儿发呆，还不如赶紧去收拾自己的东西。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "因为我自己的团队，马上就要全面入驻总编室了。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xie_ling",
      "t": "你们现在就可以考虑自己的出路了。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Realizing with a sinking heart that their crisis victory proved Xingtian could function without Chun Yuqiao, Bu Xiaogu watches Xie Ling smugly tell the old team to start looking for new jobs. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
